              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Luk 12:10",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "To moro ma luwo gima k'otire kwoŋ Cuny Maleŋ, k'ocwaki go; meno otimo gimarac ma cil gi cil.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.3.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.3.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 3:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yesu oluwo ameno rupiri jomoro oyido jotieko waco ni cuny m'ocido ni kwoŋe.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.3.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.3.30"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Wutmin Yesu gi yokimere",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 3:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.3.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.3.30"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "31",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 3:31"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yok Yesu gi wutmin go bende jotundo to jocungo woko aka jodhiro wac ni jomito neno go. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.3.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.3.31"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "32",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 3:32"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "32",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Lwak ji onwaŋo obedo piny othoko go; to jowaco rigo ni: “Yokin kodi wutmin in icade jocungo woko jomito nenin.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.3.32",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.3.32"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "33",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 3:33"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "33",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yesu odwoko ni, “Jokune ma mama gi wutmera?” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.3.33",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.3.33"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "34",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 3:34"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "34",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aka obolo waŋe oŋiyo jom'obedo piny thoko go, to waco ni, “Kole jome a mama gi wutmera. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.3.34",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.3.34"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "35",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 3:35"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "35",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Dhano je ma timo gima Were mito, ŋato am'obedo omera, kodi nyamera kodi mama.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.3.35",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.3.35"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
